
#### REGISTER

GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_A_FRESH_LOGIN_TOKEN


#### REGISTER

POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
content-type: application/json

{
  "firstname": "an",
  "lastname": "an",
  "username": "an",
  "password": "an"
}

### LOGIN

POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
content-type: application/json

{
  "username": "an",
  "password": "an"
}

### CREATE A NEW VIDEO

POST http://localhost:5000/api/video/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_A_FRESH_LOGIN_TOKEN

{
  "video": "10.mp4",
  "language": "vi",
  "noise": "deep",
  "summary": "kl",
  "sentence": 2
}

### Get Videos All

GET http://localhost:5000/api/video/getallvideo
